---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Success stories
description: Real stories from Scholar Fahad followers who won scholarships, fellowships and internships, and what helped them.
permalink: /success-stories/
---
<div class="wrap">
  <header class="page-head">
    <div class="label">Success stories</div>
    <h1>They applied. They won.</h1>
    <p>Real stories from followers who won scholarships, fellowships and internships, and what made the difference.</p>
  </header>
  {% if collections.stories.length %}
  <div class="stories">
    {% for st in collections.stories %}{% include "partials/story-card.njk" %}{% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% else %}
  <p class="empty">The first stories are on their way.</p>
  {% endif %}
  <div class="apply-box" style="margin-top:32px">
    <h2>Did you win with help from Scholar Fahad?</h2>
    <p>Share your story to inspire thousands of others. Tell us your name, what you won and how you did it. We'll only publish it with your permission.</p>
    <div class="ctas" style="margin-top:4px"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Share your story</a></div>
  </div>
</div>
